# Angular 2025 naming

This project uses Angular CLI 22 defaults. Do not generate 2016-style type suffixes.

```ts
// BAD
import { HeaderComponent } from './header.component';
export class HeaderComponent {}

// GOOD
import { Header } from './header';
export class Header {}
```

- Files: `header.ts`, `header.html`, `header.css` (not `header.component.ts`)
- Classes: `Header`, `JobsApi` (not `HeaderComponent`, `JobsService`)
- Pipes/NgModules still include the type: `DatePipe`, `date-pipe.ts`
- Keep `@Component`, selectors like `app-header`, and `imports: [Header]`
